# OVL-3, the state half: every menu style opened and closed twelve times in quick succession.
# Each opening must show the menu and each closing must leave nothing up (no stale panel). The
# harness half (flicker, fades, CPU while holding) is scripts/harness/menu-styles-check.sh.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/menus.padpack Menus
press lb
advance 150
expect overlay showing list
tap south 30
release lb
advance 300
expect overlay showing none
press rb
advance 150
expect overlay showing radial
stick right 1 0
advance 100
release rb
stick right 0 0
advance 300
expect overlay showing none
press north
advance 150
expect overlay showing buttons
